<title>USA: Southdown Inc Q1 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Southdown Inc Q1 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary profit$0.56	    loss  $0.52</p>
<p> Shr diluted profit0.55	     loss  0.52</p>
<p> Net profit	  13.6	     loss  6.6</p>
<p> Revs		  151.4		    127.4</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary  21.9		     17.3</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted  24.5		     17.3</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The company said operating net in first quarter 1997 was $13.6 million, or $0.56 per primary share ($0.55 per diluted share), compared to an operating net of $4.8 million, or $0.14 per primary share ($0.14 per diluted share) for the same period last year.</p>
<p>First quarter 1996 results includes a charge of $11.4 million, or $0.66 per share, for the early retirement of debt.</p>
</text>
